# name: test_finalize_ready_terminal_output_ends_slug_workers_and_self
  '''
  FINALIZE HANDOFF COMPLETE: finalized-work
  
  INSTRUCTIONS FOR ORCHESTRATOR:
  1. Report: "Candidate finalized-work handed off to the integration event chain. The integrator will spawn automatically when the projection reports READY."
  2. End child sessions:
     telec sessions end builder-session
     telec sessions end reviewer-session
     telec sessions end finalizer-session
  3. End this orchestrator session:
     telec sessions end self
  
  Work-stage responsibility for finalized-work is complete. Do not call telec todo work finalized-work again.
  '''
